Erin Sandra Christopher Contributions:
Conducted dataset inspection and quality assessment.
Examined dataset structure, data types, missing values, and duplicate records.
Investigated data quality issues and documented findings.
Implemented data cleaning and transformation procedures.
Removed irrelevant and target-leakage features from the dataset, including Customer ID, Churn Category, and Churn Reason.
Contributed to exploratory data analysis documentation and interpretation of results.
Prepared project documentation and supported report development.
Maintained project progress through individual GitHub commits and repository contributions.

Huyin Song Contributions:
Established and maintained the project repository structure.
Implemented dataset loading and preprocessing procedures.
Performed additional data validation, cleaning, and transformation tasks.
Investigated invalid values, abnormal values, and outlier behaviour.
Implemented categorical encoding and feature preparation procedures.
Conducted feature correlation analysis and churn distribution analysis.
Assisted in preparing project documentation, reporting materials, and project integration.
Maintained project progress through GitHub commits and repository management.
Shared Responsibilities

Both team members jointly contributed to:
Selection of the Telecom Customer Churn dataset.
Definition of the project problem and objectives.
Review and validation of data preparation decisions.
Planning and organisation of project tasks.
Preparation of Phase 1 deliverables.
Review of analysis results and overall project quality assurance.
